Security
procedure]]></Text></Note><Note x="-428" y="252" width="225" height="62"><Text><![CDATA[If Authentication is because of sync failure then use auto value for SQN.
]]></Text></Note><Note x="-562" y="492" width="87" height="49"><Text><![CDATA[Authentication
procedure]]></Text></Note><Note x="507" y="598" width="472" height="39"><Text><![CDATA[If Authentication failure is because of synch failure then set the variable "isSyncFailure" to True and
restart authentication procedure. 

]]></Text></Note><Note x="-558" y="830" width="70" height="168"><Text><![CDATA[EMM
Security
procedure]]></Text></Note><Note x="-325" y="-196" width="714" height="38"><Text><![CDATA[The procedure performs Authentication and Security procedures as per user configured parameters. In case of a Authentication failure due to
"Synch Failure" re authentication is performed.]]></Text></Note></layoutInformation></displayInformation><parameter xsi:type="CompoundParametersType"></parameter><outcome id="207" followingActionId="116" terminatorId="1"/><outcome id="208" followingActionId="95" terminatorId="2"/><outcome id="209" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="3"/><terminators><terminator id="1" index="0" acronym="End" name="End"/><terminator id="2" index="1" acronym="Err" name="Error"/><terminator id="3" index="2" acronym="SE" name="SystemError"/></terminators><caching/></action><action xsi:type="compoundAction" id="87" name="CreateAttachAcceptMessage" description="The compound procedure builds Attach Accept message"><action xsi:type="controlAction" id="34" name="LogMessage" controlActionType="LOG_MESSAGE"><parameter xsi:type="LogMessageType"><DisplayName xsi:type="xs:string">System error occured while trying to send Attach Accept message</DisplayName><Messages xsi:type="LogMessageListType"><Message xsi:type="VariableChoiceType" variable_able="USER_VARIABLE_ONLY" variable_substituted="LogString"/></Messages></parameter><outcome id="85" followingActionId="35" name="Logged"/></action><action xsi:type="controlAction" id="0" name="Start" controlActionType="START"><outcome id="0" followingActionId="20" name=""/></action><action xsi:type="controlAction" id="35" name="CompoundTerminator" controlActionType="COMPOUND_TERMINATOR"><parameter xsi:type="CompoundTerminatorType"><id>3</id></parameter></action><action xsi:type="controlAction" id="32" name="CompoundTerminator" controlActionType="COMPOUND_TERMINATOR"><parameter xsi:type="CompoundTerminatorType"><id>1</id></parameter></action><action xsi:type="controlAction" id="33" name="CompoundTerminator" controlActionType="COMPOUND_TERMINATOR"><parameter xsi:type="CompoundTerminatorType"><id>1</id></parameter></action><action xsi:type="procedureAction" id="38" name="Attach Accept" procedureActionType="General" procedureGroupName="EMM Procedures" procedureL