" y="2376"/></l><Note x="39" y="2357" width="212" height="88"><Text><![CDATA[This compound procedure builds an
Attach Accept EMM message. If applicable 
the appropriate EMM cause is inserted into
the message.]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="87" anchorIdType="1"><w x="266" y="2401"/><w x="478" y="2389"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="-237" y="1875" width="95" height="61"><Text><![CDATA[UE is now
Attached and 
Default EPS Bearer 
is established]]></Text></Note><Note x="42" y="2228" width="217" height="88"><Text><![CDATA[This compound procedure builds an
Activate Default EPS Bearer Context Request 
ESM message. ESM Cause is inserted into 
the message to support only IPv4]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="86" anchorIdType="1"><w x="274" y="2272"/><w x="431" y="2261"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="-235" y="-145" width="96" height="1975"><Text><![CDATA[Step 1a:

Switch on UE.

Wait for UE to
complete LTE
attach procedure.

As part of LTE
attach UE
successfully 
performs

NAS Authentication
NAS Security
RRC Security

A default eps
bearer is also
established during
LTE attach.]]></Text></Note><Note x="-114" y="983" width="118" height="250"><Text><![CDATA[Execution of the ESM 
Information Request 
Procedure is dependant 
on the value received in 
the PDN Connectivity 
Request]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="26" anchorIdType="1"><w x="19" y="1108"/><w x="403" y="1020"/></NoteLink></Note></layoutInformation></displayInformation><parameter xsi:type="CompoundParametersType"><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">p_accessPointName</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="USER_VARIABLE" xsi:type="AccessPointName.type" Property="DEFAULT"><defaultValue><OK xsi:type="EsmInformationResponse_ReturnData.type"><NasMessageAndSecurityInfo><value-><nasMessage><value-><content><value-><epsMobilityManagement><value-><message><value-><attachCompleteMsg><value-><esmMessage><value-><ie><value-><content><value-><epsSessionManagement><value-><message><value-><esmInformationResponseMsg><value-><accessPointName><valuemodify->OMIT</valuemodify-></accessPointName></value-></esmInformationResponseMsg></value-></message></value-></epsSessionManagement></value-></content></value-></ie></value-></esmMessage></value-></attachCompleteMsg></value-></message></value-></epsMobilityManagement></value-></content></value-></nasMessage></value-></NasMessageAndSecurityInfo></OK></defaultValue><nodePath>OK/NasMessageAndSecurityInfo/value-/nasMessage/value-/content/value-/epsMobilityManagement/value-/message/value-/attachCompleteMsg/value-/esmMessage/value-/ie/value-/content/value-/epsSessionManagement/value-/message/value-/esmInformationResponseMsg/value-/accessPointName</nodePath><procedureLibrary>LteL3Lib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment></parameter><outcome id="1961" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="2"/><outcome id="1962" followingActionId="854" terminatorId="1"/><outcome id="1963" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="3"/><outcome id="1964" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="4"/><terminators><terminator id="1" index="0" acronym="End" name="End"/><terminator id="2" index="1" acronym="Err" name="Error"/><terminator id="3" index="2" acronym="SE"